        "title": "Shift the principal value into the desired interval",
        "text": "Add the period pi to the principal value $$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$$. The result $$\\frac{5\\pi}{4}$$ falls within the required physical range of $$[\\pi, 2\\pi].$$",
